1. Missiles or failing objects; 
2. Fire; 
3. Theft or larceny; 
4. Explosion or earthquake; 
5. Windstorm; 
6. Hail, water or flood; 
7. Malicious mischief or vandalism; 
8. Riot or civil commotion; 
9. Contact with bird or animal; or 
10. Breakage of glass. 
